        <mxCell id="291" value="VERIFY (scan-limited, mirrors pg2 uncertainties): • 7493 QA–QD ↔ 1V..256V tap mapping and ÷16 jumpers; counter designators E8/E9 vs F8/F9. • Exact taps into 7410 D8 V-RESET decode and into the 7402 NOR V-BLANK latch (best inference). • D4 / E7 flip-flop pin roles; E7 is one 7474 shared between H RESET (pg2) and V RESET here. • V SYNC gate inputs (V BLANK + which V tap)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#fff8e1;strokeColor=#e0a800;dashed=1;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
