        <mxCell id="342" value="NOTES / VERIFY (mirrors pg3 uncertainties): • Clock/load source for ball-V counters: shown H RESET (line rate) + V BLANK load — verify. • Preset P0–P3: which bits from VERT VELOCITY (Aᵥ-Dᵥ) vs grounded — exact bit map unread. • 9316 load(PE) vs enable(CET) pin and CEP/CET tie-highs are inferred. • B0 / D2 gate roles and the VVID / V-COINC output net names (placeholders). • NOT TRACED (open, not N.C.): 9316 MR(1) clear source; B0 pin 5, D2 / decode other inputs." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#fff8e1;strokeColor=#e0a800;dashed=1;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
