        <mxCell id="561" value="VERIFY (densest sheet area — scan-limited; many control taps are best-inference): • SCORE-SOUND: exact interconnect of the three 7400 &#39;C3&#39; sections + C4/C1 mix is inferred; HIT vs HIT SOUND polarity and the 32V/SC gate role need confirming. F3 = 74107 (J/K/CLK read). • SERVE: F4 555 trigger path through E6 (7402+7400) and the STOP G generation (D8→B2) are skeletal; B5 PRESET/CLEAR sources and E5&#39;s third input not traced (open, NOT N.C.). • AUDIO: Q1/Q2(2N3643)/Q3 + 330/100/220 Ω + .1µF + 1N914/1N4001 shown structurally only; exact emitter/collector returns and which diode clamps which node are analog/unread. • PADDLE/VELOCITY: A9/B9 read as PADDLE-position one-shots (50K paddle pot + 256V ref → VPAD1/VPAD2), NOT serve/score timers. 7490 C7/D7 + CB + 74153 C6/D6 = ball-english generator; the 74153 data taps, G1/G2 strobes and the C7/D7 clock source are stubbed (open, NOT N.C.). Part at &#39;F5&#39; reads 7402 here, not 74121 — confirm against your copy. • +5/GND drawn only at the 555 reset ties where functionally relevant." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#fff8e1;strokeColor=#e0a800;dashed=1;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
