        <mxCell id="634" value="VERIFY (scan-limited; placement map A001433 confirms designators 7493 A8/B8, 74153 F2, 7448 C5): • 7493 A8/B8 are the per-player score counters; SCORE-pulse steering (which counter advances) and the R0 reset source are best inference — shown driving both counters (open inputs NOT N.C.). • 74153 F2 drawn as a functional P1/P2→BCD mux: a full 4-bit two-player select needs 2×74153; only F2 is located in this scan, so the exact bit split / companion chip / select polarity are unread. • 7448 C5 pinout standard (A/B/C/D=7/1/2/6; a–g=13/12/11/10/9/15/14; LT/BI tied high) — the a–g labels are legible on the sheet; confirm BI/RBO and any ripple-blanking. • Segment·position gating (7427 E5 / 7402 C2,D2 / 7410 A7) collapsed into one block: the per-segment AND with the H/V digit windows and the exact window-decode taps are not individually traced." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#fff8e1;strokeColor=#e0a800;dashed=1;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="720" width="1360" height="260" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
