        <mxCell id="673" value="VERIFY (scan-limited): • Ball video read as 7402 G1 NOR(VVID, HVID); NET (centre line) as 7427 G2 from V BLANK · 4V (the 4V stripe makes the dashed line) — G2&#39;s third input not traced (open, NOT N.C.). • Paddle bats collapsed into one functional block: each bat = its VPAD one-shot window AND the paddle&#39;s fixed H column; the exact gates, the V-height term and the L/R column taps are not individually resolved. • VIDEO combine gate type (7400/7404) and active-high/low sense of each source are best inference." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#fff8e1;strokeColor=#e0a800;dashed=1;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
